          "Register the same wrapper functions via pybind as well, using REGISTER_BINDING, to maintain compatibility with direct module calls if needed.",
          "Expect compilation to succeed and torch.ops.cuda_extension.* to be available; subsequent verification should pass numerical checks."
        ]
